      "draft": "Charlie stands outside an old 99 cent store, lost in thought. He looks around at the empty shelves and broken glass, a stark contrast to the vibrant neighborhood around him.",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "Yo, yeah back to photographing reference stall of your good shit.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "I walked into that empty 99 cent store one time. Well I almost did.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "I don't know. The door was unlocked and I thought, oh there's a set.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "But I was by myself and I was thinking, man there's no lights.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "Not only that but I might get locked in. Anything could happen.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "Not to mention it may have been illegal or something.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "But there was barely anybody there. Seems like I could walk in here for a little while.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "That looks kind of fun. I mean even just for the physicality of the space and everything.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "Even if I don't pay anybody, I guess that was a little bit cranky. I don't really want to promote this neighborhood.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "But why not? What I'm interested in is the public transit and the general temperature and climate and safety.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "The bus stop. There's more things I'm interested in.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "I mean I'm kind of a dick. But I mean try being me for a few decades.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
          "canonical_match": "CHARLIE",
          "match_score": 1.0,
          "raw_name": "CHARLIE"
        },
        {
          "character": "CHARLIE",
          "line": "Jesus Christ. I'm not even kidding. I mean try being me for a few decades and see if you don't come out a little bit fucking angry.",
          "cast_type": "canonical",
